{
  "title": "Maui 2010 - Wailele Polynesian Luau",
  "slug": "maui-2010-wailele-luau",
  "date": "2010-07-18",
  "section": "travel",
  "summary": "The Wailele Polynesian Luau tells the story of how Polynesian’s first came to the Hawaiian islands via authentic dances, songs, and colorful costumes throughout the show. Of course a luau wouldn’t be a luau without great food and the Wailele Polynesian didn’t disappoint in that regard, other than at this luau you sit at a table and people bring you the food (not exactly inline with the authentic story line ☺). A great first time luau especially for the kids, next time we will take it up a notch and let her pull some pork off a fire-roasted pig!",
